# SLICE-02 "The wall collapses, dust and smoke" (UE Chaos Destruction + Niagara): SLICE-02.desce's Wall (300 x 200 x 40 cm,
# Fractures/Wall.dfrac: 2 Uniform levels, cut from Meshes/Modeling/Wall.stmesh by SLICE-02_bake.scn) is broken by
# WallBlast, a Radial Impulse Field at the wall's centre, fired as an explicit step AFTER the intact shot (palette
# "Fire Field 'WallBlast'", the same path as Destruction.applyField; UE: an event calling ApplyPhysicsField) --
# not by a script timer, which raced the shot: Simulate's reply waits for the editor to settle, so a 1 s timer
# had already fired before the first advance began. Its base level-1 nodes are anchored (Destructible Anchored
# Nodes 5,11-14,17, UE anchor field): unanchored, the resting contact with the ground broke them on Simulate's first
# step, raising sparks before any field fired. The wall's breaks / collisions / removals reach its script
# (DestructionDust.lua, UE OnChaosBreakEvent / OnChaosPhysicsCollision / OnChaosRemovalEvent), which writes them
# into the VFX data channels BreakDust / ImpactDust / SettleDust (UE: write to a Niagara Data Channel); WallDust's
# emitters (VFX/WallDust.dfx: BreakDust, BreakSmoke, BreakSparks, LandingDust) spawn from those entries at the
# break and landing points. The scenario does not save the scene.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene SLICE-02.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -800,190,-60
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.17,0.78
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид 0_intact the wall standing whole (seen from its left, in front), no particles around it
Когда run Action "Fire Field 'WallBlast'"
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид 1_break the wall's pieces flying apart from its centre, bright orange additive sparks and a tan dust burst at the break points
Когда advance 1.3
Когда advance 1.2
Тогда-вид 2_settle the pieces lying on the ground where the wall stood, grey smoke rising over a tan dust cloud; the broken faces show the orange-brown interior material (Starter_Prop)
Когда run Action Stop
